After step 14 lock_destination_availability, add step 14a: release_operator_resource da op

Now operator is free again.

Now for schedule candidates we need to assign operator again.

Now continue.

Step 23: create_candidate sa

Step 24: allocate_vehicle_unit sa vg (use gamma)

Step 25: attach_task_profile sa rtp

Step 26: confirm_candidate_preparedness sa rtp

Step 27: assign_operator_resource sa op

