Step 35: finalize_candidate_direct sa (parameters: ?candidate - schedule_candidate). So finalize_candidate_direct sa

Now sa is dispatch_ready.

Now allocate dispatch slot and execute schedule dispatch.

Step 36: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate sa ds rtp

Step 37: execute_schedule_dispatch sa vg ds

Now sa dispatched, vehicle vg available, slot available.

Now we need to do same for sb.

But note that after we loaded container alpha onto leg, loading_container_alpha is now not available (loaded). Loading_container_beta is still available.

We also have loading_container_leg_linked for alpha; beta not yet linked.

Now we need to prepare sb similarly.

Step 38: create_candidate sb

Step 39: allocate_vehicle_unit sb va (vehicle alpha now available after oa dispatch)

Step 40: attach_task_profile sb rtp

Step 41: confirm_candidate_preparedness sb rtp

Step 42: assign_operator_resource sb op

