Step 49: establish_clearance_nominal sb cc lcbeta tl

Step 50: finalize_candidate_direct sb

Step 51: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate sb ds rtp

Step 52: execute_schedule_dispatch sb va ds

Now all four dispatched.

We should also consider any needed cleanup? Not required for goal.

Now we must verify that all preconditions are satisfied at each step.

