Step3: attach_task_profile oa rtp. Precondition: candidate_created oa, vehicle_allocated oa, route_task_profile_available rtp. route_task_profile_available rtp true from init. Good. Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked oa rtp, not route_task_profile_available rtp.

Step4: confirm_candidate_preparedness oa rtp. Precondition: candidate_created oa, vehicle_allocated oa, candidate_task_profile_linked oa rtp, not candidate_prepared oa. All true. Effect: candidate_prepared oa.

Step5: assign_operator_resource oa op. Precondition: candidate_prepared oa, operator_available op. operator_available op true from init. Effect: candidate_operator_linked oa op, not operator_available op.

Step6: activate_origin_node oa on rtp. Precondition: candidate_prepared oa, candidate_task_profile_linked oa rtp, origin_availability_node_linked oa on, not origin_node_ready on, not origin_node_occupied on. origin_availability_node_linked oa on true from init. origin_node_ready on false initially, origin_node_occupied on false. Good. Effect: origin_node_ready on.

Step7: lock_origin_availability oa on op. Precondition: candidate_prepared oa, candidate_operator_linked oa op, origin_availability_node_linked oa on, origin_node_ready on, not origin_availability_locked oa. All true. Effect: origin_availability_locked oa, origin_availability_confirmed oa.

Step7a: release_operator_resource oa op. Precondition: candidate_operator_linked oa op. True. Effect: operator_available op, not candidate_operator_linked oa op.

Now operator free.

Step8: create_candidate da. Precondition: not candidate_created da, not dispatched da. Good.

Step9: allocate_vehicle_unit da vb. Precondition: candidate_created da, not vehicle_allocated da, vehicle_available vb. vehicle_available vb true initially. Good.

